句奉呈诸幕友 其三","author":"曾丰","text":"风里为生露作粮，腹中潇洒正清凉。\n长歌商颂声初振，细听韶音味可忘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77511,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闻蝉五绝句奉呈诸幕友 其四","author":"曾丰","text":"静坐幽眠自反听，我新两耳似蝉鸣。\n今日更向耳边噪，会忘归真作一声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77512,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闻蝉五绝句奉呈诸幕友 其二","author":"曾丰","text":"羽仙尘外学修行，未蜕那知身已轻。\n露里厌为无事饮，风前戏作不平鸣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77513,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闻蝉五绝句奉呈诸幕友 其五","author":"曾丰","text":"语那似默得便宜，蝉谩三叹复五噫。\n养气何妨为孟子，知音不必要钟期。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77514,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闻德寿皇帝庆七十","author":"曾丰","text":"尧寿元非啜雉羹，秦皇汉武却营营。\n有心去采三山药，何似归休一日兵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77515,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"阁皂山道士晏时中过我南浦久之告归 其三","author":"曾丰","text":"客里相逢天一涯，吾归未得羡君回。\n闽山荔子量分去，庾岭梅花剩寄来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77516,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"阁皂山道士晏时中过我南浦久之告归 其二","author":"曾丰","text":"孟阳风月小弥明，犹子于今有典刑。\n已得旌阳传道妙，犹从彭泽乞诗灵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77517,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"阁皂山道士晏时中过我南浦久之告归 其一","author":"曾丰","text":"忘家未足更忘形，散客孤云迹不停。\n三楚江山心未饱，七闽泉石眼初醒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77518,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"值侯修学趣儒人稍急因遗莲花莲实西瓜于吾宗翔叔作诗以勉之 其三","author":"曾丰","text":"绀色毬儿护水晶，味甘如蜜冷如冰。\n香风飘满葵丘戍，散与鸮林解郁蒸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77519,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"值侯修学趣儒人稍急因遗莲花莲实西瓜于吾宗翔叔作诗以勉之 其二","author":"曾丰","text":"珠房颗颗绿英英，兴味超然芹藻馨。\n不必铁槌挝碎却，苦心应念子衿青。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77520,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"值侯修学趣儒人稍急因遗莲花莲实西瓜于吾宗翔叔作诗以勉之 其一","author":"曾丰","text":"绛玉裁花碧玉茎，亭亭香远韵逾清。\n群仙竞倚西风笑，为报临淮政已成。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77521,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"校艺排号次成二绝呈元辅 其一","author":"曾丰","text":"坡老不期遗李廌，欧公犹误取刘晖。\n点头道有朱衣吏，今古相传未必非。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77522,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"校艺排号次成二绝呈元辅 其二","author":"曾丰","text":"明日谯楼榜已开，网疏宁免有遗才。\n诸生莫作冬烘看，二老曾经眊氉来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77523,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"留别金陵故旧","author":"曾丰","text":"公家事毕更何为，回眷钱塘臂欲飞。\n留客故人虽意厚，倚门有母待儿归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77524,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秦望山 其二","author":"曾丰","text":"锐意秦皇初学仙，要和鸡犬也升天。\n那知身与鲍俱臭，嬴氏炊寒不复烟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77525,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秦望山 其一","author":"曾丰","text":"六国争雄已坐擒，更何所望此登临。\n真成驭鹤乘鸾去，未惬秦皇好大心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77526,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"罢县解归途中闻子规 其三","author":"曾丰","text":"陶令先几归去来，云何谢令要人催。\n子规误认陶为谢，莫怪区区劝又催。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77527,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"罢县解归途中闻子规 其二","author":"曾丰","text":"轻舍柴桑悔欲追，虽无所激亦谋归。\n子规大似相知浅，犹虑渊明未见机。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77528,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"罢县解归途中闻子规 其一","author":"曾丰","text":"黎侯无补邑之民，业已言归岂诳人。\n中露泥中非所恋，子规何用更谆谆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77529,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"瑩老自浙归住东广光孝移住南华 其五","author":"曾丰","text":"制止寺中房相砚，曹溪堂上祖师衣。\n旧家公案新拈起，两样机关一指归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77530,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"瑩老自浙归住东广光孝移住南华 其四","author":"曾丰","text":"无苦那从复觅甘，堂头与水已相谙。\n犹将达磨泉中意，更去曹溪滴里参。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77531,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"瑩老自浙归住东广光孝移住南华 其三","author":"曾丰","text":"终年尽日讲楞严，舌自深藏口自缄。\n脚指今将舌头去，悬知满阁是空函。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77532,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"瑩老自浙归住东广光孝移住南华 其二","author":"曾丰","text":"重脱袈裟挂广州，与人说法口如流。\n放生池里鱼倾耳，受戒坛前石点头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77533,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"瑩老自浙归住东广光孝移住南华 其一","author":"曾丰","text":"南宗要勘北机关，踏遍江湖淮浙山。\n始信广东元有佛，打包依旧更南还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77534,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄内","author":"曾丰","text":"已复山上山，何当口中口。\n写兹秋下心，寄我女边帚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77535,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄题盘山云峰通济桥 其二","author":"曾丰","text":"通往通来无四旁，津梁未必不相妨。\n吾行拗折津梁柱，尽放途人蹈大方。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77536,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄题盘山云峰通济桥 其一","author":"曾丰","text":"何人彼岸幻长虹，接引众生入大通。\n彼此本来无间断，度人了后勿论功。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77537,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅岭有松无竹","author":"曾丰","text":"与梅结友问为谁，松竹中含霜雪姿。\n竹岂寒盟已仙去，宿心惟有老松知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77538,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"清湘城西飞来峰 其三","author":"曾丰","text":"鬼输天雨玉崔嵬，乞与湘人眼豁开。\n为报湘人莫私有，飞来有日更飞回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77539,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"清湘城西飞来峰 其二","author":"曾丰","text":"三处飞来一样奇，佛无所择我何辞。\n重轻较到毫釐处，鸣雁行中此白眉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77540,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"清湘城西飞来峰 其一","author":"曾丰","text":"解后南鹏怒辄翔，乘风附翼过清湘。\n罗浮本是仙家景，借与如来作宝坊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77541,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"随牒至南康军呈李宰 其四","author":"曾丰","text":"南来摸索子长胸，已有东坡独秀峰。\n再过峰前问鱼鸟，尽归陶令锦囊中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77542,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"随牒至南康军呈李宰 其三","author":"曾丰","text":"乘闲赢得答江山，答了江山未得闲。\n堕泪碑中恩有剩，凌烟阁上事犹悭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77543,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"随牒至南康军呈李宰 其二","author":"曾丰","text":"善刀初不露锋芒，五柳围门琴卧堂。\n百里桑麻春塞眼，四时风月夜搜肠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77544,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"随牒至南康军呈李宰 其一","author":"曾丰","text":"蹀躞骐骝去路宽，西清太冷北门寒。\n且将东观编摩手，来作南康拊字官。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77545,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"彭澄之告以卜筑佐之一缗一石二绝句以为亲旧倡 其二","author":"曾丰","text":"家无储粟况储钱，佐费吾其以义先。\n一石一缗未为厚，量渠背负与腰缠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77546,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"彭澄之告以卜筑佐之一缗一石二绝句以为亲旧倡 其一","author":"曾丰","text":"今难复用古橧巢，头上应须盖把茅。\n金屋少为书所绐，数椽新拟卜西郊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4c